### 10. Collapse/Accordion

Box có thể mở/đóng.

```html
<div class="collapse">
  <button class="collapse-header" aria-expanded="false">
    <span>Tiêu đề Collapse</span>
    <svg class="collapse-icon w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
    </svg>
  </button>
  <div class="collapse-body">
    <p>Nội dung collapse...</p>
  </div>
</div>
```

**CSS:**
```css
.collapse {
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-primary);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.collapse-header {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  background-color: var(--color-gray-50);
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: var(--font-size-base);
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
}

.collapse-header:hover {
  background-color: var(--color-gray-100);
}

.collapse-icon {
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

.collapse[aria-expanded="true"] .collapse-icon {
  transform: rotate(180deg);
}

.collapse-body {
  padding: 1.25rem;
  background-color: var(--color-bg-primary);
  max-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease;
}

.collapse[aria-expanded="true"] .collapse-body {
  max-height: 500px;
  padding: 1.25rem;
}
```

